From bec009b8dcd80288f4ef1d5f18ef42f4756822b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 14:48:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(motion): engrave and trace placed sketch chains

Follow directed lines and arcs through setup placement. Retract between strokes, preserve stepped cutting depths, and verify marks against physical stock before posting. Refuse arcs too small for the post and split major sweeps.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Refs #1869
